usage: msep_single_study.py [-h] --dataset {uji,uts,tuji} --output OUTPUT
                            [--data-root DATA_ROOT] [--device DEVICE]
                            [--seed SEED] [--split-seed SPLIT_SEED]
                            [--base-epochs BASE_EPOCHS] [--patience PATIENCE]
                            [--joint-epochs JOINT_EPOCHS] [--batch BATCH]
                            [--threads THREADS] [--support {all,topk}] [--k K]
                            [--es-draws ES_DRAWS] [--smoke]

MSEP-Loc single-member full experimental protocol (FIT/DEV/CAL/TEST). Run from
repository root: python -m fhm_dapp_tim.fhm_dapp.msep_single_study --dataset
tuji --output ... No Git operations; no pre-trained checkpoints or official-
test labels required.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dataset {uji,uts,tuji}
  --output OUTPUT
  --data-root DATA_ROOT
  --device DEVICE
  --seed SEED
  --split-seed SPLIT_SEED
  --base-epochs BASE_EPOCHS
  --patience PATIENCE
  --joint-epochs JOINT_EPOCHS
  --batch BATCH
  --threads THREADS
  --support {all,topk}
  --k K
  --es-draws ES_DRAWS
  --smoke               DEV-only diagnostics; do not evaluate TEST
